# Reopen frame_stations' stores; verify floating custody and window survive.
settle 30
assert pane roster
assert snap floats == roster
assert windows == 2
assert snap lens-float-count == 0
assert snap frame-focus-slot == none
assert snap a11y-lens-windows == 1
capture 04_shared_float_reopened
frame-a11y-window 0 focus tab 1
assert snap frame-focus-slot == 0
key escape
act Dock pane
settle 10
assert event pane-docked roster
assert snap float-count == 0
capture 05_shared_float_docked
log shared float reopen and dock draft complete
